{"name":"Mayonnaise","hex":"#f6eed1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Mayonnaise","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["In full Mayonnaise sauce or sauce Mayonnaise: alternative letter-case form of mayonnaise."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Mayonnaise"}],"entries":[{"title":"Mayonnaise","blocks":[{"text":"Mayonnaise, colloquially referred to as \"mayo\", is a thick, creamy sauce with a rich and tangy taste that is commonly used on sandwiches, hamburgers, bound salads, and French fries. It also forms the base for other sauces, including tartar sauce, fry sauce, remoulade, salsa golf, ranch dressing, and rouille."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Mayonnaise_%281%29.jpg/330px-Mayonnaise_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayonnaise","wikidata":"Q167893"},{"title":"Mayonnaise (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Mayonnaise are a five-piece Filipino alternative rock band, fronted by Monty Macalino and famous for winning the \"Red Horse Muziklaban\" contest in 2004."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Mayo_latest.jpg/330px-Mayo_latest.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayonnaise_(band)","wikidata":"Q6797610"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Ingredients_maonesa.jpg/500px-Ingredients_maonesa.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Ingredients_maonesa.jpg/500px-Ingredients_maonesa.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Standard ingredients and tools to make mayonnaise","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AIngredients_maonesa.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Mayonnaise_ingredi